Z||000000||Richard Parnell||05-04-2000||02:25 AM||||Last night I was surfing the channels and on A & E they had a show about ricers racing on the street in some city (didn't catch where) and the cops chasing them . They interviewed some of them them and they were about the stupidest sounding morons I've heard in a while.  Well to get to the point, in one scene the camera panned across a really nice looking white Fiero in the middle of all the ricers.  It's like you know some times you see really cool looking babes with idiots.  It's not their fault.  The babes I mean.||||reg||4
